{"id":10037235473,"name":"[UPD] New York: The Hood","desc":"\n\n🌟 New York: The Hood is an RK/RP Game, with many features!\nREVAMP UPDATE OUT NOW!\n\nTo get a gun, go to the gun store or join a Turf\nJoin our community server linked below for more info!\n\n🔫 Have shootouts with rival gang members!\n💰 Rob the BANK!\n💼 Work a Legal Job such as delivering crates!\n🖨️ Print money and get RICH!\n💸 Build your criminal empire!\n🚗 Flex your wealth in a supercar!\n\n🌟 Join this group for an extra $2,500! https://www.roblox.com/groups/15197701/New-York-The-Hood#!/about\n\n🚧 The game is still in development, expect frequent updates and report bugs in the communications server.\n\nTags - Hood, Da Hood, Chicago, Untitled Hood, Legends, ChicBlocko, FiveM, OBLOCK, Tha Bronx, Tha Bronx 2, NYC: The Projects, The Projects, Shootout, NYC","path":"/game/10037235473-new-york-the-hood","slug":"10037235473-new-york-the-hood","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"playing":0,"visitor":1824632,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-30T22:12:40.899Z","creator":{"name":"The Hood Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"633769d8ac6777387bddf28d","title":"AUTO FARM SCRIPT","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7890d","gameId":10037235473,"name":"[UPD] New York: The Hood","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"slug":"10037235473-new-york-the-hood","path":"/game/10037235473-new-york-the-hood","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":10037235473},"slug":"UPD-New-York:-The-Hood-AUTO-FARM-SCRIPT-6136","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":7737,"executes":101,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-script.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/3d624e5258f7cf72086affccff4456c3